4	//! Prompt formatting (lib/llm side).
5	//!
6	//! The reusable chat-template / prompt-formatting engine lives in the
7	//! standalone, runtime-free [`dynamo_renderer`] crate. This module holds only the
8	//! lib/llm-local glue that can't live there:
9	//!   * implements [`OAIChatLikeRequest`] for Dynamo's `Nv*` request wrappers,
10	//!   * keeps media-IO config off the rendering trait via [`MediaRequestExt`]
11	//!     (so `dynamo_renderer` need not depend on the media module),
12	//!   * adapts a [`ModelDeploymentCard`] into a [`PromptFormatter`]
13	//!     ([`prompt_formatter_from_mdc`]).
14	//!
15	//! Everything else imports from `dynamo_renderer` directly.
16	
